      "value": "Perhaps unrelated, but maybe another aspect of this could be a texture “downscaler” of sorts? Basically, you set your max texture size in game, let’s say 2k. Then in game, if there is an avatar with 4k textures, they could get downscaled/reduced to a smaller size, like 2k? I sense that would be pretty difficult to do, but just an idea I had.",
